===persian===

من باید نقاشی کنم...
یالِ اسب‌ها ناتمام است...
و... نگاهم به تو...
ناتمام تر...
سالِ نو رسید...
بیا از اولین نگاه... آغاز کنیم...
۱۳۶۹/۱/۱

===machine===

I must paint...
The manes of the horses are unfinished...
and... my gaze toward you...
more unfinished still...
The new year has come...
come, let us begin from the first look...
1369/1/1

===lantern===

I have to paint...
The manes of the horses are unfinished...
and... my gaze toward you,
more unfinished still...
The new year has come...
come, let us begin from the first look...

1369/1/1

